  "id": "cheesy-garlic-baguette",
  "name": "Cheesy Garlic Baguette",
  "subtitle": "A crisp baguette filled with herbed garlic cheese",
  "description": "A simple Italian-style bread preparation combining creamy cheeses, garlic, butter, and herbs inside a scored baguette.",
